<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11524] Memory leak caused by executing a jdbc prepared statement</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11524</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Executing a prepared statement multiple times lead to OOM.&lt;br/&gt;
VisualVM indicates that heap contains  a lot of JdbcThinPreparedStatament objects.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The reproducer is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
