                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16792488" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 14 Mar 2019 09:33:50 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;-&amp;gt; Run :: SQL: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3304072&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAllSql&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;-&amp;gt; Run :: SQL&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16792490" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Thu, 14 Mar 2019 09:35:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, please review the patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16793438" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 15 Mar 2019 08:11:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=tledkov-gridgain&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;tledkov-gridgain&quot;&gt;tledkov-gridgain&lt;/a&gt;, my comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;I would propose to use identity-based set (from &lt;tt&gt;IdentityHashMap&lt;/tt&gt;) instead of standard &lt;tt&gt;HashSet&lt;/tt&gt;, as it looks more natural for this use case&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Shouldn&apos;t we clear and close tracked statements on connection close? I would do that just for the sake of safety, because this will decrease memory pressure should user leak &lt;tt&gt;Connection&lt;/tt&gt; object somehow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16795030" author="ignitetcbot" created="Mon, 18 Mar 2019 13:50:36 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;-&amp;gt; Run :: SQL: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3322922&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAllSql&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;-&amp;gt; Run :: SQL&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16795035" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Mon, 18 Mar 2019 13:58:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
1. Fixed,&lt;br/&gt;
2. &lt;tt&gt;JdbcThinConnection#stmts&lt;/tt&gt; is cleared on close. I guess the statements shouldn&apos;t close explicitly on connection close:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The object on server side are cleared by &lt;tt&gt;onDisconnect&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;On client side &lt;tt&gt;JdbcThinStatement#isClosed&lt;/tt&gt; check connection state.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;It takes additional  time on close to send not useful close commands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;I guess clear &lt;tt&gt;JdbcThinConnection#stmts&lt;/tt&gt; is enough for decrease memory pressure when {{JdbcThinConnection}}s leak at user code.&lt;br/&gt;
We have to nullify the content of the &lt;tt&gt;JdbcThinStatement&lt;/tt&gt; to reduce memory pressure  when {{JdbcThinStatement}}s leak at user code.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16795784" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 19 Mar 2019 07:35:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=tledkov-gridgain&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;tledkov-gridgain&quot;&gt;tledkov-gridgain&lt;/a&gt;, I meant only client part. This is true that we should not send any additional close requests to the server. This point was to clear collection of statements as they are not viable anymore, so no need to keep inside &lt;tt&gt;Connection&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16795785" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 19 Mar 2019 07:38:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=tledkov-gridgain&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;tledkov-gridgain&quot;&gt;tledkov-gridgain&lt;/a&gt;, my comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;JdbcThinConnection&lt;/tt&gt; - let&apos;s use Set instead of Map (&lt;tt&gt;stmts = Collections.newSetFromMap(IdentitiyMap)&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;JdbcThinConnection.close&lt;/tt&gt; - statements should be cleared under &lt;tt&gt;stmtsMux&lt;/tt&gt;, aren&apos;t they?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16801502" author="ignitetcbot" created="Tue, 26 Mar 2019 09:15:47 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;-&amp;gt; Run :: SQL: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=3352478&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAllSql&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;-&amp;gt; Run :: SQL&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16801503" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Tue, 26 Mar 2019 09:16:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, fixed, please take a look.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16802865" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 27 Mar 2019 14:33:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=tledkov-gridgain&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;tledkov-gridgain&quot;&gt;tledkov-gridgain&lt;/a&gt;, merged to master. Though, I removed heap dumps from the test and added check for statements field size instead.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
